      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوْدَلٌ</span></b>  The <i>mustache.</i> (S, IAar, K.) You say,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَالَ سَوْدَلُهُ</span>, (As, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوْدَلَاهُ</span>, (IAar,) <i>His mustache,</i> or <i>mustaches, became long.</i> (As, IAar, K.)

